{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>demo version</strong> of <i>Veil of Torment</i>, representing roughly <strong>25\u201330% of the full game\u2019s content</strong>.<br>The demo includes the <strong>introductory chapters</strong> of the story, allowing players to experience the core gameplay, atmosphere, and early objectives within <strong>Black Water Asylum</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please note that some features, areas, and story elements are <strong>not included</strong> in this demo and will be available only in the <strong>full release</strong>. This demo is intended to give players a preview of the gameplay, visuals, and overall tone of the final game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2705 <strong>Included in the Demo</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access to the opening chapters of the game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Core gameplay features and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Early story progression, characters, and environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Initial puzzles / combat / objectives\u00a0</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u274c <strong>Not Included in the Demo</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full story and all levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Final gameplay systems and polish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete enemy types, items, or features planned for full release</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4154180?t=1762481461","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154180/e9bc4a77bfd78346739039d1cfcf817a29657241/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762481461","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4154180/1317a6e3ac4d6aa11dd687bb7b1a17169f4c2096/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762481461","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steam